{"seq":2,"slug":"ionic-covalent-bonding","title":"离子键与共价键理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/atoms-bonding/ionic-covalent-bonding","wordCount":1590,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"离子键与共价键理论\">离子键与共价键理论</h1><p>钠遇上氯，一个心甘情愿丢电子，一个迫不及待抢电子，结果生成稳定的食盐晶体；而两个氢原子谁也不肯放手，便共用一对电子结成分子。这两幕戏就是化学键的两种极端——离子键与共价键。这一篇专门讲「原子凭什么、以什么能量代价结合」，是 Lewis 结构、晶格能、价键理论与分子轨道理论的主场。原子半径与电负性等概念直接沿用<a href=\"atomic-structure-periodicity\">原子结构与周期性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>化学键的本质是原子结合时体系总能量降低。判断走哪条路，最简便的依据是电负性差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>χ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\chi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span></span></span></span></span>：差值很大（一般 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>χ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\chi &gt; 1.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.7</span></span></span></span></span>）倾向离子键，差值小则倾向共价键，中间地带是极性共价键。但这只是连续谱上的人为划界，真实的键几乎都带有部分离子性与部分共价性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[两个原子接近] --&gt; B{电负性差 Δχ}&#10;  B --&gt;|很大| C[电子转移&lt;br/&gt;离子键]&#10;  B --&gt;|很小| D[电子共用&lt;br/&gt;共价键]&#10;  B --&gt;|中等| E[极性共价键]&#10;  C --&gt; F[晶格能&lt;br/&gt;玻恩-哈伯循环]&#10;  D --&gt; G[价键理论 / 分子轨道理论]&#10;  E --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[两个原子接近] --&gt; B{电负性差 Δχ}\n  B --&gt;|很大| C[电子转移&lt;br/&gt;离子键]\n  B --&gt;|很小| D[电子共用&lt;br/&gt;共价键]\n  B --&gt;|中等| E[极性共价键]\n  C --&gt; F[晶格能&lt;br/&gt;玻恩-哈伯循环]\n  D --&gt; G[价键理论 / 分子轨道理论]\n  E --&gt; G</pre><p>下表对比两类键的特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>离子键</th>\n<th>共价键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成键方式</td>\n<td>电子转移</td>\n<td>电子共用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向性</td>\n<td>无（球对称库仑场）</td>\n<td>有（轨道重叠方向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型物态</td>\n<td>高熔点晶体</td>\n<td>分子或原子晶体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导电性</td>\n<td>熔融/溶液导电</td>\n<td>一般不导电</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量度量</td>\n<td>晶格能</td>\n<td>键能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"离子键与晶格能\">离子键与晶格能</h2><p>离子键的强度由晶格能衡量——把一摩尔离子晶体拆成无限远的气态离子所需能量。它无法直接测量，却能通过玻恩—哈伯循环用赫斯定律间接求出，该循环把升华、解离、电离、电子亲和与晶格能串成一个闭合能量回路。晶格能近似服从玻恩—兰德公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = -\\frac{N_A M z^+ z^- e^2}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 r_0}\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{n}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4411em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是马德隆常数（由晶体几何决定），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z^+z^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是离子电荷乘积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是离子间距。由此可读出两条规律：电荷越高、离子越小，晶格能越大，晶体越稳定、熔点越高。MgO 比 NaCl 熔点高得多，正因为前者电荷乘积是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>。晶体几何本身（马德隆常数的来源）在<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/solid-state-materials-inorganic\">固体与材料无机化学</a>中详讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价键理论与-lewis-结构\">价键理论与 Lewis 结构</h2><p>共价键最朴素的图像是 Lewis 结构：用点表示价电子，原子通过共用电子对达到八隅体。它能快速给出成键骨架与孤对电子数，但说不清键的方向与分子形状。价键理论（VB）补上这一层——共价键来自两个原子各出一个含未成对电子的原子轨道沿核间轴重叠。轨道沿键轴头碰头重叠成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 键（可绕键轴自由旋转），平行肩并肩重叠成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 键（限制旋转、贡献双键三键的额外结合）。</p>\n<p>VB 理论的核心扩展是杂化轨道，它解释了为什么甲烷四个 C—H 键完全等同。杂化与由此决定的分子几何是<a href=\"molecular-geometry-vsepr-hybridization\">分子几何、VSEPR 与杂化</a>的专题，本篇只点明它属于 VB 框架，不展开 sp/sp²/sp³ 的几何细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分子轨道理论\">分子轨道理论</h2><p>VB 理论把电子定域在两个原子之间，遇到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的顺磁性就解释不通了。分子轨道理论（MO）改用离域观点：原子轨道线性组合成遍布整个分子的分子轨道，每个 MO 有确定能量，电子按能量最低、泡利、洪特规则填入。两个原子轨道组合出一个能量降低的成键轨道与一个能量升高的反键轨道，键级定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>键级</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>成键电子数</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>反键电子数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{键级} = \\frac{(\\text{成键电子数} - \\text{反键电子数})}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">键级</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成键电子数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">反键电子数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>键级越高，键越强越短。MO 理论的胜利在于自然解释了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有两个未成对电子（填在简并的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反键轨道上）因而顺磁，这是 VB 理论无能为力的。MO 的思想推广到无限多原子，便是固体的能带理论，详见<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/solid-state-materials-inorganic\">固体与材料无机化学</a>；推广到金属配合物，则演化为<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/crystal-field-ligand-field-theory\">晶体场与配位场理论</a>中的配位场理论。</p>\n<p>两大共价键理论的分工可用一张表看清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>价键理论（VB）</th>\n<th>分子轨道理论（MO）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电子位置</td>\n<td>定域于两原子之间</td>\n<td>离域遍布整个分子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轨道图像</td>\n<td>原子轨道直接重叠</td>\n<td>原子轨道线性组合成 MO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键量</td>\n<td>键的数目与类型</td>\n<td>键级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>擅长解释</td>\n<td>几何与杂化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 顺磁、电子光谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局限</td>\n<td>说不出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的顺磁性</td>\n<td>图像抽象、计算量大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"极化与键型的连续过渡\">极化与键型的连续过渡</h2><p>把离子键与共价键看成两个极端，中间的过渡靠「极化」连接，这是法扬斯规则的核心。一个阳离子会把邻近阴离子的电子云拉向自己，使原本「纯离子」的键带上共价成分。阳离子电荷越高、半径越小，极化能力越强；阴离子越大、电荷越高，越容易被极化（变形性大）。于是 AgCl 虽由金属与卤素组成，却因银离子极化能力强而带明显共价性、难溶于水，与典型离子化合物 NaCl 行为迥异。</p>\n<p>法扬斯规则因此能解释一系列「反常」：为何 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>AlCl</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AlCl}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AlCl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是低熔点的共价分子而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>AlF</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AlF}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AlF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是高熔点离子晶体（氟小、难极化），为何过渡金属化合物普遍比同价主族化合物更共价（d 电子屏蔽差、阳离子极化强）。这把「电负性差判键型」的粗判据细化成可解释熔点、溶解度、颜色的工具，也预告了后面<a href=\"../descriptive-chemistry/transition-metal-chemistry\">过渡金属化学</a>中许多化合物为何偏共价的根源。理解键型是连续谱而非二选一，是无机化学成熟思维的标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电负性差决定键型走向，但离子—共价是连续谱，真实键多为两者混合。</li>\n<li>离子键强度由晶格能度量，玻恩—哈伯循环间接求值，电荷高、离子小则晶格能大。</li>\n<li>价键理论用轨道重叠解释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 键，其杂化扩展的几何细节交由分子几何篇。</li>\n<li>分子轨道理论以离域观点引入键级，成功解释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 顺磁，并通向能带与配位场理论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"离子键与共价键理论","id":"离子键与共价键理论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"离子键与晶格能","id":"离子键与晶格能"},{"level":2,"text":"价键理论与 Lewis 结构","id":"价键理论与-lewis-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"分子轨道理论","id":"分子轨道理论"},{"level":2,"text":"极化与键型的连续过渡","id":"极化与键型的连续过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"原子结构与周期性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/atoms-bonding/atomic-structure-periodicity"},"next":{"title":"分子几何、VSEPR 与杂化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/atoms-bonding/molecular-geometry-vsepr-hybridization"}}